WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.395 --> 00:00:03.125
(bright, bouncy music)

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:04.192
- [Voiceover] Graham crackers.

00:00:04.192 --> 00:00:06.283
Often best when paired
with melted marshmallows

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:07.477
and chocolate.

00:00:07.477 --> 00:00:09.909
But it didn't start out as a sugary snack.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:12.512
Originally, they tasted like cardboard,

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.345
and they were intended
to curb your sex drive.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.819
It all started with Sylvester Graham,

00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:26.080
a nineteenth century
minister who believed that

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.555
alcohol, meat and fatty foods led

00:00:28.555 --> 00:00:31.925
to greed, lust and sexual urges.

00:00:31.925 --> 00:00:34.758
And, well, that had to be stopped.

00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:38.112
Graham's cure was simple.

00:00:38.112 --> 00:00:42.279
He preached that bland foods
would curb sexual appetite,

00:00:43.988 --> 00:00:46.732
and he developed a cracker
made of unbleached flour,

00:00:46.732 --> 00:00:50.399
wheat germ, bran and
definitely no sugar.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:54.427
Voila, the graham cracker was born.

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:58.636
Graham's theory, and his crackers, gained

00:00:58.636 --> 00:01:00.086
a cult-like following.

00:01:00.086 --> 00:01:03.286
His loyal devotees called
themselves Grahamites.

00:01:03.286 --> 00:01:05.974
But as time wore on, Graham's
theories tipped the scale

00:01:05.974 --> 00:01:09.430
of extremism and eventually
he lost his popularity.

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:12.204
He died in 1851 and that's
when the graham cracker

00:01:12.204 --> 00:01:13.484
began to change.

00:01:13.484 --> 00:01:15.446
Over time it went through
many modifications,

00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:18.774
until the National Biscuit
Company, now known as Nabisco,

00:01:18.774 --> 00:01:21.798
came around and successfully
sweetened the bland cracker

00:01:21.798 --> 00:01:26.150
with some honey, and sometimes
cinnamon, and chocolate.

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:28.582
However you choose to
eat your graham cracker,

00:01:28.582 --> 00:01:30.715
don't leave out the marshmallow.

00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:34.132
(light musical flourish)

